    "Recent Transactions" : {

    },
    "Records where you are when you create a transaction, so it can be shown on a map later. Firefly III has no supported way to save a location, so Hotaru stores it as an extra line inside the transaction's notes and hides that line from you. Other Firefly clients and the web interface will show it as plain text. Expect this to change once Firefly III supports locations properly." : {
